-- The counter at The Ship: nothing comes off it while Jory is behind the
-- bar. A Veto, asked of what holds the thing before it is taken.

on beforeRemove actor, thing, deciding
  ask world to named "jory"
  put it into jory
  if jory is not nothing and jory is not actor then
    if the in of the location of jory is the in of the location of the target then
      veto `Jory slides the ${lower(the name of the described of thing)} out of your reach. "That's paid for, that is."`
    end if
  end if
  pass beforeRemove
end beforeRemove
